;Description
:This template is used to link to a Twitcasting channel.
;Syntax
:Place <code><nowiki>{{Twitcast|<twitcastingchannel>}}</nowiki></code> and substitute <twitcastingchannel> with the latter part of the Twitcasting link (e.g., if the link is https://twitcasting.tv/c:coe_oo, the twitcastingchannel will be "c:coe_oo"). If necessary, use the article's talk page to discuss further details.

;Example<nowiki>:</nowiki>
:<pre>{{Twitcast|c:coe_oo|coe twitcast description}}</pre>

;Will result in<nowiki>:</nowiki>
:{{Twitcast|c:coe_oo|coe twitcast description}}

;note<nowiki>:</nowiki>
:description field is optional.

